# An image that was built without the library (the engine's default: these tests, the fuzzers, --no-builtin-modules) runs the engine's own functions from their text
# LIBRARY: own
# RUN: run-in-shell globalThis.report = message => print(message);
# CHECK: 2,4
# CHECK-NEXT: 2
# CHECK-NEXT: tea2
# CHECK-NEXT: exited with 0
# RUN(IMAGE): image
# IMAGE-NOT: IsBuiltWithLibrary
# PROGRAM-OF: text-of-an-engine-built-in-that-the-image-lacks-is-refused-where-the-build-held-the-library.ir
